# Build artifacts only. Cargo.lock is deliberately RE-INCLUDED: the repo
# root .gitignore ignores every non-root Cargo.lock, but this workspace's
# lockfile is load-bearing (iceoryx2 family must stay pinned =0.9.1 in
# lockstep with the repo lockfile — the binary<->cdylib skew class).
/target/
!Cargo.lock
# Transient per-size ping-source backup made by run_workspace.sh's period
# rewrite (restored on exit; self-healing across a killed run).
*.orig
# crosshost/crosshost.py renders its graphs here (they carry the run's
# addresses and certificate paths) and writes config/iceoryx2.toml for the run.
graphs/xhost_*.yaml
config/iceoryx2.toml
